    "body": "Completely drive-by, unrelated comment: your example could be written thusly, and it would work (at least in Chromium):\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<div id=\"outer\">\r\n  <template shadowroot=open shadowrootdelegatesfocus=true>\r\n    <div id=\"inner\">\r\n      <template shadowroot=open shadowrootdelegatesfocus=false>\r\n        <input>\r\n      </template>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </template>\r\n</div>\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
