    "body": "I think I lost the plot a bit, but this new algorithm first goes through descendants and then the shadow host's shadow tree, right? That means that in\r\n\r\n- div\r\n   - host\r\n      - #shadow delegatesFocus\r\n          - x autofocus\r\n   - y autofocus\r\n\r\ny gets focus.",
